WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.649
The first question sells our solution.

00:00:02.649 --> 00:00:05.740
It does not investigate the person's experience.

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:15.896
Better questions begin with the work as it happens: where someone looks, what interrupts the task, and what they need to do next.

00:00:15.896 --> 00:00:22.961
We can ask AI to suggest neutral questions, but we must review them before using them.
